flowchart TD
  Need[Need formal approval] --> Q1{Linear object-tied steps and existing classic process?}
  Q1 -->|Yes maintain| Classic[Classic approval process; lock and step actions]
  Q1 -->|New dynamic routing or record-triggered start| FlowAP[Flow Approval Process]
  Need --> Q2{Already in a screen Flow gathering comments?}
  Q2 -->|Call existing classic| Submit[Submit for Approval action]
  Q2 -->|Call Flow-based| Action[Action to autolaunched Flow Approval Process]
  Need --> Q3{Just notify someone?}
  Q3 -->|No lock or audit needed| NotAppr[Email or Task in a regular Flow - not an approval process]
